    "Keep tasks visible in desktop notes on your Mac, and take them with you on iPhone. Share the download link to your Mac to get started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep tasks visible in desktop notes on your Mac, and take them with you on iPhone. Share the download link to your Mac to get started."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén tus tareas a la vista en las notas del escritorio del Mac y llévalas contigo en el iPhone. Comparte el enlace de descarga con tu Mac para empezar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez vos tâches visibles dans des notes sur le bureau de votre Mac et emportez-les sur iPhone. Partagez le lien de téléchargement avec votre Mac pour commencer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将任务放在 Mac 桌面便签上，随时可见；用 iPhone 随身携带。将下载链接分享到 Mac，即可开始使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep what matters in sight": {
