    "Remember to call the electrician on Monday about the kitchen lights. Ask for a morning appointment and a quote.": {
      "comment": "Realistic mock single memo for the Pro preview; never user content.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remember to call the electrician on Monday about the kitchen lights. Ask for a morning appointment and a quote."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordar llamar al electricista el lunes por las luces de la cocina. Pedir una cita por la mañana y un presupuesto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Penser à appeler l’électricien lundi au sujet des lumières de la cuisine. Demander un rendez-vous le matin et un devis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记得周一给电工打电话，询问厨房照明的问题。请他安排上午上门，并提供报价。"
          }
